{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>Therefore</b> — After she knows that all this evil has come upon her because she forgot me and did not know at first that it was I who did good with her, and she says: I will go and return to my first husband, then I will entice her with words." "<b>And I will lead her</b> — to a land that has turned like a wilderness."], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:49:57.055617118Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}